{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Oakley and Elmer on their whimsical adventure through a stunning archipelago filled with people to befriend and secrets to uncover. Though simply tasked with finding a strange mythical creature, the two robots are distracted by the beauty of the islands.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore and Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, climb, and crawl across the islands as you collect and find new items and tools!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be a part of the Community!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why are we always so pressured by efficiency? Work together with many fun and quirky people as you each learn to relax and enjoy the beauty around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unwind in a Recovering Paradise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although on a top secret mission, the distractions here are plentiful! <i>Surely our bosses won\u2019t mind if we fish for a little while longer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042040/extras/Walk-Cycle_Duo-resize.gif?t=1742510451\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3042040?t=1742510451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042040/73ce0ae734289ee05323f9f7ae26a4bb3aac0bd0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742510451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042040/2bc95cdb952c62edd4169b2e474df3a9211e02dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742510451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042040/2bc95cdb952c62edd4169b2e474df3a9211e02dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742510451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full co